  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">General Aviation and Business Aviation Development Project, through U.S. Chamber of Commerce</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USTDA funding will support a General Aviation Development Implementation Support Project in cooperation with the U.S.-China Aviation Cooperation Program (ACP). This project will assist the Civil Aviation Administration of China (CAAC) in its efforts to open the operation of low altitude airspace and develop an expanded general aviation sector in China, including helicopters, seaplanes and air traffic management technologies.</narrative>
  </description>
